@context: One hunt, many inputs — the whole file runs once per CSV row, and each column is a {variable}.
@title: data_driven
@tags: smoke

@var: {site} = http://localhost:8000
# The path is relative to this file. A .json file holding a list of objects works too.
@data: data/users.csv

STEP 1: Log in as {username}
    NAVIGATE to {site}/login.html
    FILL 'Username' field with '{username}'
    FILL 'Password' field with '{password}'
    CLICK the 'Sign in' button
    VERIFY that 'Welcome, {username}' is present
    VERIFY 'Role' field has value '{role}'

DONE.
